// Native SM5.1 rewrite of materialsystem/stdshaders/TreeLeaf_ps2x.fxc for logical treeleaf_ps20b (legacy profile ps20b);
// generated mechanically by gensource.py, then reviewed. Combo directives are the ps20b set.
#define DX12_LEGACY_PS20B 1
#include "dx12_preamble.h"
// STATIC: "CONVERT_TO_SRGB" "0..1"	[= g_pHardwareConfig->NeedsShaderSRGBConversion()]

#define HDRTYPE HDR_TYPE_NONE
#include "common_ps_fxc.h"

struct PS_INPUT
{
	float2 texCoord0;
	float3 color;
};
// Exact mirror of the paired vertex output (same types, order and interpolation) so the signatures
// link register-for-register.
struct DX12_PS_INPUT
{
	float4 projPos : SV_Position;
	float2 texCoord : TEXCOORD0;
	float3 color : COLOR;
};
PS_INPUT DX12ConvertInput( DX12_PS_INPUT dx12In )
{
	PS_INPUT l = (PS_INPUT)0;
	l.texCoord0 = dx12In.texCoord;
	l.color = dx12In.color;
	return l;
}


Texture2D BaseTextureSampler_Texture : register( t0 );
SamplerState BaseTextureSampler_Sampler : register( s0 );
static const DX12Sampler2D BaseTextureSampler = { BaseTextureSampler_Texture, BaseTextureSampler_Sampler };

HALF4 main( DX12_PS_INPUT dx12In ) : SV_Target0
{
	PS_INPUT i = DX12ConvertInput( dx12In );
	float4 baseTex = BaseTextureSampler.tex.Sample( BaseTextureSampler.smp, i.texCoord0 );	
	return DX12FinishPixel( FinalOutput( baseTex * float4( i.color, 1 ), 0, PIXEL_FOG_TYPE_NONE, TONEMAP_SCALE_NONE ), 0.0f );
}

